; First Steps in Inuktitut / ᐃᓄᒃᑎᑐᑦ (iu)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

ᓅᑎᕆᕗᖅ box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
ᐃᓚᓯᕗᖅ box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
ᐃᓚᖔᖅᐹ box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
ᖃᕆᑕᐅᔭᐅᑉ_ᑐᒃᓯᕋᐅᑎᖓ box         ; Show the final candy count!
